STAFF REPORT - SUMMATION

Lot 14, Block 5, Replat Homestead Addition, First Filing
Annexation

CASE NUMBER:
UDC-18-00069

SUBDIVISION CODE: HAN 01
PREPARED BY:
Eric Hammer / Seth Lloyd

MEETING DATES:
April 9, 2018 – City Council

 1st Reading/ Public Hearing
April 17, 2018 – Public Services Committee

1st Reading
April 23, 2018 – City Council

2nd Reading
May 8, 2018 – Public Services Committee

2nd Reading
May 14, 2018 – City Council

3rd Reading

REQUIRED DOCUMENTS SUBMISSION: The following required documents have been submitted and
reviewed by staff.

•
Master Application; Petition Signed by Property Owners; Annexation Map; Soils Deferral
Request - Submitted 2/23/2018 as the original project submission.

STAFF RECOMMENDATION: Staff recommends conditional approval by the Governing Body with the
following two (2) conditions:

1. Correct the title block, per comments by Planning and Development Staff.
2. Survey tie to one boundary course (2 corners) and coordinates from two (2) City Control
Monuments, using State Plane Coordinates, per comments by the City Surveyor.
